VioletCity_Interior3_Text_Man::
	.string "POKéMON are smart.\n"
	.string "They won’t obey a trainer\l"
	.string "they don’t respect.\p"
	.string "Without the right GYM BADGES, they\n"
	.string "will just do as they please.$"

VioletCity_Interior3_Text_Scientist_1::
	.string "{PLAYER}, long time, no see.\p"
	.string "PROF.ELM asked me to find you.\n"
	.string "He has another favor to ask.$"

VioletCity_Interior3_Text_Scientist_2::
	.string "{PLAYER}, will you take the EGG?$"

VioletCity_Interior3_Text_Scientist_3::
	.string "B-but... PROF.ELM asked for you...$"

VioletCity_Interior3_Text_Scientist_4::
	.string "Oh, no. You can’t carry any more\n"
	.string "POKéMON with you.\p"
	.string "I’ll wait here while you make\n"
	.string "room for the EGG.$"

VioletCity_Interior3_Text_Scientist_5::
	.string "{PLAYER} received EGG.$"

VioletCity_Interior3_Text_Scientist_6::
	.string "We discovered that a POKéMON will not\n"
	.string "hatch until it grows in the EGG.\p"
	.string "It also has to be with other active\n"
	.string "POKéMON to hatch.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, you’re the only person\n"
	.string "we can rely on.\p"
	.string "Please return to ELM’s LAB when that\n"
	.string "EGG hatches!$"
